戶置一內史，凡內史四十三。單于左右輔，各主六夷十萬落，萬落置一都尉。省吏部，置左右選曹尚書。自司隸以下六官，皆位次僕射。置御史大夫及州牧，位皆亞公。以其子粲為丞相","source_term":"以其子粲為丞相"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-w044-luchen-can-father","interpretation_note":"原文明記兩代；人號不表長幼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-jinshu-044-luchen","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen","raw_mention_count":4,"mention_ids":["c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0073","c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0078","c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0100","c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0102"],"paragraph_ids":["c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0073","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0073"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0078","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0078"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0100","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0100"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0102","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0102"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":4,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":4,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"4處獨立位置，4個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"},{"source_id":"s-jinshu-102-jin044-luchen","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-102","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-102-jin044-luchen","raw_mention_count":3,"mention_ids":["c-jinshu-102-jin044-luchen:family:m0218","c-jinshu-102-jin044-luchen:style:m0000","c-jinshu-102-jin044-luchen:style:m0002"],"paragraph_ids":["c-jinshu-102-jin044-luchen:family","c-jinshu-102-jin044-luchen:style"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-jinshu-102-jin044-luchen:family:m0218","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-102-jin044-luchen:family:m0218"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"can