","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-102-jin044-luchen:family","quote":"聰以劉易為太尉。初置相國，官上公，有殊勳德者死乃贈之。於是大定百官，置太師、丞相，自大司馬以上七公，位皆上公，綠綟綬，遠遊冠。置輔漢，都護，中軍，上軍，輔軍，鎮、衛京，前、後、左、右、上、下軍，輔國，冠軍，龍驤，武牙大將軍，營各配兵二千，皆以諸子為之。置左右司隸，各領戶二十餘萬，萬戶置一內史，凡內史四十三。單于左右輔，各主六夷十萬落，萬落置一都尉。省吏部，置左右選曹尚書。自司隸以下六官，皆位次僕射。置御史大夫及州牧，位皆亞公。以其子粲為丞相","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-102-jin044-luchen:family:m0218","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-102-jin044-luchen:family:m0000"}],"interpretation_note":"此條按本句所明言。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067","text":"諶字子諒，清敏有理思，好《老》《莊》，善屬文。選尚武帝女滎陽公主，拜駙馬都尉，未成禮而公主卒。後州舉秀才，辟太尉掾。洛陽沒，隨志北依劉琨，與志俱為劉粲所虜。粲據晉陽，留諶為參軍。琨收散卒，引猗盧騎還攻粲。粲敗走，諶得赴琨，先父母兄弟在平陽者，悉為劉聰所害。琨為司空，以諶為主薄，轉從事中郎。琨妻即諶之從母，既加親愛，又重其才地。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"諶","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"子諒","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"hgm_jvn_hle","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0028","start":28,"end":32,"surface":"滎陽公主","kind":"person","person_id":"hgm_jvn_hle_B","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"公主","kind":"person","person_id":"hgm_jvn_hle_B","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0063","start":63,"end":64,"surface":"志","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"劉琨","kind":"person","person_id":"b21_e55_8bd","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0070","start":70,"end":71,"surface":"志","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"劉粲","kind":"person","person_id":"d96_1fa_e9a_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0078","start":78,"end":79,"surface":"粲","kind":"person","person_id":"d96_1fa_e9a_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0084","start":84,"end":85,"surface":"諶","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0089","start":89,"end":90,"surface":"琨","kind":"person","person_id":"b21_e55_8bd","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"猗盧","kind":"person","person_id":"f90_933_c35","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0100","start":100,"end":101,"surface":"粲","kind":"person","person_id":"d96_1fa_e9a_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0102","start":102,"end":103,"surface":"粲","kind":"person","person_id":"d96_1fa_e9a_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0106","start":106,"end":107,"surface":"諶","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0109","start":109,"end":110,"surface":"琨","kind":"person","person_id":"b21_e55_8bd","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0123","start":123,"end":125,"surface":"劉聰","kind":"person","person_id":"d96_1fa_e9a","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0128","start":128,"end":129,"surface":"琨","kind":"person","person_id":"b21_e55_8bd","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0134","start":134,"end":135,"surface":"諶","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0145","start":145,"end":146,"surface":"琨","kind":"person","person_id":"b21_e55_8bd","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen:line067:m0148","start":148,"end":149,"surface":"諶","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":67,"last_line":67,"revision_id":1775345},"source_quote":{"witness":"j44","quote":"　　諶字子諒，清敏有理思，好《[[老子|老]]》《[[莊子|莊]]》，善屬文。選尚武帝女滎陽公主，拜駙馬都尉，未成禮而公主卒。後州舉秀才，辟太尉掾。洛陽沒，隨志北依劉琨，與志俱為劉粲所虜。粲據晉陽，留諶為參軍。琨收散卒，引猗盧騎還攻粲。粲敗走，諶得赴琨，先父母兄弟在平陽者，悉為劉聰所害。琨為司空，以諶為主薄，轉從事中郎。琨妻即諶之從母，既加親愛，又重其才地。","raw_start":5453,"raw_end":5633,"raw_line":67},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-luchen"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064","text":"及東海王越奉迎大駕，顒啟帝復穎還鄴，以志為魏郡太守，加左將軍，隨穎北鎮。行達洛陽，而平昌公模遣前鋒督護馮嵩距穎。穎還長安，未至而聞顒斬張方，求和於越。穎住華陰，志進長安，詣闕陳謝，即還就穎于武關。奔南陽，復為劉陶所驅，回詣河北。及穎薨，官屬奔散，唯志親自殯送，時人嘉之。越命志為軍諮祭酒，遷衛尉，永嘉末，轉尚書。洛陽沒，志將妻子北投并州刺史劉琨。至陽邑，為劉粲所虜，與次子謐、詵等俱遇害於平陽。長子諶。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0001","start":1,"end":5,"surface":"東海王越","kind":"person","person_id":"9o2_vhv_r7y","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"顒","kind":"person","person_id":"ed0_313_bea","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0014","start":14,"end":15,"surface":"穎","kind":"person","person_id":"e81_f09_000","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"志","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0032","start":32,"end":33,"surface":"穎","kind":"person","person_id":"e81_f09_000","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0042","start":42,"end":46,"surface":"平昌公模","kind":"person","person_id":"a6t_8s4_3jz","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"馮嵩","kind":"person","person_id":"4cf_cwf_cdc","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0054","start":54,"end":55,"surface":"穎","kind":"person","person_id":"e81_f09_000","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0056","start":56,"end":57,"surface":"穎","kind":"person","person_id":"e81_f09_000","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0065","start":65,"end":66,"surface":"顒","kind":"person","person_id":"ed0_313_bea","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"張方","kind":"person","person_id":"eti_fp9_fq5","status":"contex