ce":"劉琨","kind":"person","person_id":"b21_e55_8bd","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0178","start":178,"end":180,"surface":"劉粲","kind":"person","person_id":"d96_1fa_e9a_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0186","start":186,"end":187,"surface":"謐","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0188","start":188,"end":189,"surface":"詵","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBC","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0199","start":199,"end":200,"surface":"諶","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":64,"last_line":64,"revision_id":1775345},"source_quote":{"witness":"j44","quote":"　　及東海王越奉迎大駕，顒啟帝復穎還鄴，以志為魏郡太守，加左將軍，隨穎北鎮。行達洛陽，而平昌公模遣前鋒督護馮嵩距穎。穎還長安，未至而聞顒斬張方，求和於越。穎住華陰，志進長安，詣闕陳謝，即還就穎于武關。奔南陽，復為劉陶所驅，回詣河北。及穎薨，官屬奔散，唯志親自殯送，時人嘉之。越命志為軍諮祭酒，遷衛尉，永嘉末，轉尚書。洛陽沒，志將妻子北投并州刺史劉琨。至陽邑，為劉粲所虜，與次子謐、詵等俱遇害於平陽。長子諶。","raw_start":5238,"raw_end":5441,"raw_line":64},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-luzhi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-102-jin044-luchen:family","text":"聰以劉易為太尉。初置相國，官上公，有殊勳德者死乃贈之。於是大定百官，置太師、丞相，自大司馬以上七公，位皆上公，綠綟綬，遠遊冠。置輔漢，都護，中軍，上軍，輔軍，鎮、衛京，前、後、左、右、上、下軍，輔國，冠軍，龍驤，武牙大將軍，營各配兵二千，皆以諸子為之。置左右司隸，各領戶二十餘萬，萬戶置一內史，凡內史四十三。單于左右輔，各主六夷十萬落，萬落置一都尉。省吏部，置左右選曹尚書。自司隸以下六官，皆位次僕射。置御史大夫及州牧，位皆亞公。以其子粲為丞相","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-102-jin044-luchen:family:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"聰","kind":"person","person_id":"d96_1fa_e9a","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-102-jin044-luchen:family:m0218","start":218,"end":219,"surface":"粲","kind":"person","person_id":"d96_1fa_e9a_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","source_quote":{"witness":"j102","quote":"聰以劉易為太尉。初置相國，官上公，有殊勳德者死乃贈之。於是大定百官，置太師、丞相，自大司馬以上七公，位皆上公，綠綟綬，遠遊冠。置輔漢，都護，中軍，上軍，輔軍，鎮、衛京，前、後、左、右、上、下軍，輔國，冠軍，龍驤，武牙大將軍，營各配兵二千，皆以諸子為之。置左右司隸，各領戶二十餘萬，萬戶置一內史，凡內史四十三。單于左右輔，各主六夷十萬落，萬落置一都尉。省吏部，置左右選曹尚書。自司隸以下六官，皆位次僕射。置御史大夫及州牧，位皆亞公。以其子粲為丞相","raw_start":4686,"raw_end":4908,"raw_line":36},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-102-jin044-luchen","book_id":"b-jinshu-102","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-102-jin044-luchen"},{"id":"c-jinshu-102-jin044-luchen:style","text":"粲字士光。少而俊傑，才兼文武。","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-102-jin044-luchen:style:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"粲","kind":"person","person_id":"d96_1fa_e9a_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-102-jin044-luchen:style:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"士光","kind":"person","person_id":"d96_1fa_e9a_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","source_quote":{"witness":"j102","quote":"粲字士光。少而俊傑，才兼文武。","raw_start":11778,"raw_end":11793,"raw_line":107},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-102-jin044-luchen","book_id":"b-jinshu-102","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-102-jin044-luchen"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-luchen","source":{"title":"晉書卷四十四","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1775345","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1775345","revision_id":1775345,"accessed_on":"2026-11-21","extent":"固定數位題「志子諶」題下全文。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代本文及維基文庫數位轉錄。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","edition":"維基文庫固定修訂1775345","raw_path":"sources/jinshu/wikisource-1775345-raw.wikitext","wikitext_sha256":"09742e651b479fea881fd24c7734